        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<style>\nbody{background:#0E1322!important}\n.react-grid-item section{background:#151C30!important;border:1px solid rgba(201,206,216,.10)!important;border-radius:14px!important;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.28)!important}\n[data-testid^=\"data-testid Panel header\"] h2{font-weight:600!important;letter-spacing:.01em}\n[data-testid^=\"data-testid dashboard-row-title\"]{color:#F2A65A!important;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:13px!important}\n.cp-chip{display:inline-block;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(244,241,234,.06);border:1px solid rgba(244,241,234,.14);color:#F4F1EA;font-size:12px;margin:3px}\n.cp-chip b{color:#F2A65A}\n</style><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:14px;\nbackground:linear-gradient(120deg,#12182B 0%,#1B2440 62%,#2A1F14 100%);border:1px solid rgba(242,166,90,.35)\">\n<div><div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#F4F1EA;line-height:1.2\">CryptoPulse <span style=\"color:#F2A65A\">BTC</span> · <span style=\"color:#4C9BE8\">SOL</span> <span style=\"color:#C9CED8;font-size:14px;font-weight:500\">Julmer · cómo se obtiene: Caída fuerte a 30 minutos</span></div>\n<div style=\"color:#C9CED8;font-size:13px\">Anticipar el riesgo con 5 a 30 minutos de antelación · Grupo 3 · Big Data UPeU 2026-2</div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:right\"><span class=\"cp-chip\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #F2A65A\"><b style=\"color:#F2A65A\">Volatilidad</b> · Franck</span><span class=\"cp-chip\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #E5534B\"><b style=\"color:#E5534B\">Caídas</b> · Julmer</span><span class=\"cp-chip\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #3FB68B\"><b style=\"color:#3FB68B\">Actividad</b> · Abdul</span><span class=\"cp-chip\" style=\"border-left:3px solid #B48EF0\"><b style=\"color:#B48EF0\">Separación</b> · Luz Milagros</span></div></div>"
      },
